{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 17, "width": 2210.5, "height": 1075, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 1585333284, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 289547071, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "OR7meZuxYl4Ee4JeZWTO", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 689.7, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1501996801, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 51984297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ML model serving platform: versions + A/B, global clients", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ML model serving platform: versions + A/B, global clients", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0YDi6LoYi8U4XcQfCjHd", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 515.9000000000001, "height": 175.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 64634663, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1941625258, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements (ask first)\n- clients: apps or services? one call = request/response or stream?\n- how many models, what sizes (MB to 100 GB)? latency per class?\n- peak req/s, per region? regions? may a call cross regions?\n- A/B: % split, sticky by user or customer, canary %?\n- who owns the GPUs, is cost a constraint? what is 'rollout done'?\nEngineer: register model, upload version, deploy to pool/region,\nrun an experiment between two versions, roll out / roll back.\nClient: call one stable endpoint per model, get result or stream.\nOperator: see per-version, per-arm health.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements (ask first)\n- clients: apps or services? one call = request/response or stream?\n- how many models, what sizes (MB to 100 GB)? latency per class?\n- peak req/s, per region? regions? may a call cross regions?\n- A/B: % split, sticky by user or customer, canary %?\n- who owns the GPUs, is cost a constraint? what is 'rollout done'?\nEngineer: register model, upload version, deploy to pool/region,\nrun an experiment between two versions, roll out / roll back.\nClient: call one stable endpoint per model, get result or stream.\nOperator: see per-version, per-arm health.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "WvJztBYvwWlwGGkVEfud", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 223.0, "width": 631.4000000000001, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 1476349815, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 490964732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Technical challenges\n- sizes differ 1000x: one GPU per small model, many per large\n- loading 100 GB takes minutes: never cold-start on the request path\n- global clients, one registry: rules may be seconds stale, calls never fail on it\n- sticky A/B assignment must be a cheap hash on the hot path\n- GPU cost: batching + bin-packing decide the bill\n- availability > consistency on inference; consistency in the control plane", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Technical challenges\n- sizes differ 1000x: one GPU per small model, many per large\n- loading 100 GB takes minutes: never cold-start on the request path\n- global clients, one registry: rules may be seconds stale, calls never fail on it\n- sticky A/B assignment must be a cheap hash on the hot path\n- GPU cost: batching + bin-packing decide the bill\n- availability > consistency on inference; consistency in the control plane", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "sXRfCrhbr2DH8hKxlR1b", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 373.5, "width": 685.3000000000001, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1816375883, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1763699224, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities\nModel(id, name, owner, aliases prod->v7, canary->v8)\nModelVersion(model, version, artifact URI, checksum, size, GPU mem, status) immutable\nDeployment(version, region, pool, replicas, GPU class, generation, status)\nExperiment(model, arms[], key: user|customer, stop criteria)\nArm(experiment, version, weight %, pinned customers[])\nReplica(node, GPUs, version, state: pulling->loaded->warm->ready(v,G)->serving->draining)\nNot entities: the request (metered), the batch (runtime), the region (partition key)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities\nModel(id, name, owner, aliases prod->v7, canary->v8)\nModelVersion(model, version, artifact URI, checksum, size, GPU mem, status) immutable\nDeployment(version, region, pool, replicas, GPU class, generation, status)\nExperiment(model, arms[], key: user|customer, stop criteria)\nArm(experiment, version, weight %, pinned customers[])\nReplica(node, GPUs, version, state: pulling->loaded->warm->ready(v,G)->serving->draining)\nNot entities: the request (metered), the batch (runtime), the region (partition key)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "UTl7valx9UZZd9cdeo6L", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 541.5, "width": 616.0, "height": 157.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 2051012830, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 440151140, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /models   POST /models/{id}/versions (signed upload URL)\nPOST /deployments {version, region, replicas, gpu_class, canary_pct}\nPOST /experiments {model, arms, key}   POST /rollouts/{id}/pause|resume|rollback\nPOST /v1/models/{name}:predict {inputs, version?, user_key?} -> result | stream\n   response carries served_version + arm\nGET /models/{id}/versions/{v}/status -> loaded, ready, serving per region\ninternal: POST /replicas/{id}/report {generation, version, state}\n          routers watch a routing-rules snapshot per model", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /models   POST /models/{id}/versions (signed upload URL)\nPOST /deployments {version, region, replicas, gpu_class, canary_pct}\nPOST /experiments {model, arms, key}   POST /rollouts/{id}/pause|resume|rollback\nPOST /v1/models/{name}:predict {inputs, version?, user_key?} -> result | stream\n   response carries served_version + arm\nGET /models/{id}/versions/{v}/status -> loaded, ready, serving per region\ninternal: POST /replicas/{id}/report {generation, version, state}\n          routers watch a routing-rules snapshot per model", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "owrOkHn8XPFYSuJdoDMR", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 727.0, "width": 592.9000000000001, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 1048451829, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1862841746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\n- cold start of a large version on scale-up -> warm pool + NVMe pre-placement\n- registry on the hot path -> cached rules snapshot, last-known-good\n- bad canary visible only in quality -> experiment log + stop criteria\n- big model starves small ones -> per-version queues, shed by tier", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\n- cold start of a large version on scale-up -> warm pool + NVMe pre-placement\n- registry on the hot path -> cached rules snapshot, last-known-good\n- bad canary visible only in quality -> experiment log + stop criteria\n- big model starves small ones -> per-version queues, shed by tier", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "tcg3xmUT7lBdLYBdrHfL", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1905513029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1570447790, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "uFylaomt9xupeV1RNcLE"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "cXLaYYeOHgP84LhYySkl"}], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "uFylaomt9xupeV1RNcLE", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 93.25, "width": 280, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 402547040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1923130234, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ML engineer / release owner", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "tcg3xmUT7lBdLYBdrHfL", "originalText": "ML engineer / release owner", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "gUtJE8uGHZM4EwDsEMO8", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0009", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1030961466, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 957426288, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "TgQNVEAblGHVBoqgjpIR"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "cXLaYYeOHgP84LhYySkl"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "7yVECUfDbvvLoSRveIcW"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "nNjHUAXigkvvmDlOPBCd"}], "updated": 1790573240449, "cr