, errors, p99", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GPU util, errors, p99", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0Xc4HXPYTBEuNbg1LfMV", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 805, "width": 962.5000000000001, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0077", "roundness": null, "seed": 1995540331, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1452506813, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure / cold start: a large version is never loaded on the request path. Warm pool + NVMe pre-placement before the rollout;\nif a region has no ready replica, fail over (extra latency) instead of erroring.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure / cold start: a large version is never loaded on the request path. Warm pool + NVMe pre-placement before the rollout;\nif a region has no ready replica, fail over (extra latency) instead of erroring.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Q0KXpHJTz9MfkdRbgMn2", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 865, "width": 1039.5, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0078", "roundness": null, "seed": 1423891377, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1846611724, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say: 10k req/s peak \u00b7 100 models, 100 MB\u2013100 GB \u00b7 small model batch 32 / 10 ms \u2192 3,200 req/s per GPU \u2192 4 GPUs for 10k, run 6\n100 GB pull at 10 Gbit/s = 80 s + NVMe\u2192GPU \u2248 20 s + warm-up \u2192 minutes, so a version switch is control-plane only\nqueue target 70% util \u00b7 rules stale by seconds is fine, calls never fail on the registry", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say: 10k req/s peak \u00b7 100 models, 100 MB\u2013100 GB \u00b7 small model batch 32 / 10 ms \u2192 3,200 req/s per GPU \u2192 4 GPUs for 10k, run 6\n100 GB pull at 10 Gbit/s = 80 s + NVMe\u2192GPU \u2248 20 s + warm-up \u2192 minutes, so a version switch is control-plane only\nqueue target 70% util \u00b7 rules stale by seconds is fine, calls never fail on the registry", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kC6kQmHlIS8EUt09R44M", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 950, "width": 1078.0, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0079", "roundness": null, "seed": 837376288, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1912856139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Rollout: canary 10% \u2192 watch per-arm errors, p99, quality \u2192 50% \u2192 100%\nrollback = new generation, rules revert, v8 drains. A/B: sticky hash(key, experiment id); analysis reads the experiment log, not the router.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Rollout: canary 10% \u2192 watch per-arm errors, p99, quality \u2192 50% \u2192 100%\nrollback = new generation, rules revert, v8 drains. A/B: sticky hash(key, experiment id); analysis reads the experiment log, not the router.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "BsSMIHQYr05HQjgbVmmk", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 1010, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0080", "roundness": null, "seed": 896744322, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1738425754, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Legend", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Legend", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "RtlyaRF2QNGFWxuT7ss0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 1040, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0081", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 325942801, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 826315488, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "CSAy78SnjIarT5T1OVI8", "type": "text", "x": 450, "y": 1041, "width": 150.15, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "Cx2kUhpYP9Rqn51OJeD9", "index": "a0082", "roundness": null, "seed": 913554098, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180330345, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790573240449, "created": 1790573240449, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "client / other region", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily"